.RS 4
Download a mailing list archive as an mbox file to \fIstdout\fR.\&
.PP
Options are:
.PP
\fB-d\fR, \fB--days\fR <int>
.RS 4
Number of last days for which the archive should be downloaded.\&
By default the entire archive will be selected.\&
.PP
.RE
