.PP
Options are:
.PP
\fB--count\fR <int>
.RS 4
Number of mailing lists to fetch.\&
.PP
.RE
.RE
\fBpatchset apply\fR <ID>
.RS 4
Apply a patchset.\&
.PP
.RE
\fBpatchset list\fR [list] [options.\&.\&.\&]
.RS 4
List patchsets in list.\&
.PP
Options are:
.PP
\fB--count\fR <int>
.RS 4
Number of patchsets to fetch.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-s\fR, \fB--status\fR <string>
.RS 4
Filter by patchset status.\& By default only "PROPOSED" patchsets will be
displayed.\& Use "" to show all patchsets.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB-u\fR, \fB--user\fR
.RS 4
List patchsets by user instead of by list.\&
